#: ../../source/index.rst:5 a758e8ef54194ba89c70ed7a9f56d594
msgid "_`Introduction`"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../source/index.rst:7 b03730196ce54c35bac7a2ef81c3cafe
msgid ""
":code:`foc` is a field-oriented-control library for three-phase PMSM "
"drives. One engineering constraint drives every design choice: **the "
"control loop must be predictable** — no heap, no exceptions, no virtual "
"calls, no hidden allocation in the code path that runs every PWM period."
msgstr ""
":code:`foc` 是面向三相 PMSM 的磁场定向控制（FOC）库。所有设计取舍都服务"
"于同一条工程约束： **控制环必须可预测** ——跑在每个 PWM 周期的代码路径里"
"没有堆、没有异常、没有虚函数调用、没有隐式内存分配。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:11 073e79bf3d504f948a42ca2c78533730
msgid "Three consumer faces share one implementation:"
msgstr "三个使用面共用同一份实现："

#: ../../source/index.rst:13 b8e32a8c630441ab9b5d889699162629
msgid "One core, three faces"
msgstr "一个内核，三个使用面"

